cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SKSurrogate: a Python toolkit for surrogate-based optimization of expensive functions"
abstract: >-
  A scikit-learn-native suite implementing surrogate-guided optimization for expensive
  objectives, primarily hyperparameter and AutoML pipeline search. Since v0.2.0 the default
  response surface is an un-tuned RBF GaussianProcessRegressor; an equal-budget benchmark suite
  and a with-vs-without surrogate ablation are published and reproducible.
